              "title": "Emerging Marine Zooanthroponosis: Unraveling the Survival, Persistence, and Gene Transfer Dynamics of Human Derived Antibiotic Resistant Pathogens in Coastal Waters",
              "primary": true,
              "talk_id": "143d35fe-62ec-475f-95d1-9a4dc06484e6"
